# Stack: Go in `{{ path }}/`

- Standard layout: `cmd/<binary>/main.go`, private code in `internal/`.
  Prefer the standard library. Add a dependency only with a reason in the PR.
- Errors: wrap with `fmt.Errorf("...: %w", err)`. No panics in library code.
- Tests: table-driven, `_test.go` next to the code, `go test ./...`.
- Format: gofmt (the hook runs it on every edit). Lint: `go vet`, plus golangci-lint in CI.
- Check: `scripts/check.sh go`.
